# runs/ is deliberately NOT ignored. The run records and their ledgers are the
# evidence behind CLAIMS.md, and a claim you cannot audit is a claim you should
# not make. They are synthetic and PII-redacted at write time
# (tests/test_pii.py asserts nothing raw survives), so there is nothing here
# that should not be public. The deployed dashboard reads these same files.

